OL,3,ALiechtenstein MPs vote to legalise
OL,4,Aabortion despite threat of veto
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiechtenstein's parliament has narrowly
OL,7,Fbacked a citizens' initiative to
OL,8,Flegalise abortion during the first 12
OL,9,Fweeks of pregnancy.
OL,11,FThe initiative, led by a group of
OL,12,Fwomen, would also lift a nationwide ban
OL,13,Fon providing information about
OL,14,Fabortions and make the procedure
OL,15,Feligible for health insurance.
OL,17,FIt was approved by 13 votes to 12 in
OL,18,Fthe 25-seat parliament. However, it is
OL,19,Funlikely to become law as the country's
OL,20,Fall-powerful ruler, Hereditary Prince
OL,21,FAlois, has previously said he will veto
OL,22,Fthe legislation.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
