OL,3,ALiechtenstein MPs vote to legalise
OL,4,Aabortion despite threat of veto
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupporters of the bill say there is
OL,7,Fwidespread backing in Liechtenstein to
OL,8,Flegalise abortion. However, MPs
OL,9,Frejected a separate proposal to put the
OL,10,Fissue to a public vote.
